  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low, cover with lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6948a1c05c42f1f3135f1d4b/step-2c635f00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.\n• Thinly slice radish. Roughly chop baby spinach.\n• In a medium bowl, combine radish, spinach and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6948a1c05c42f1f3135f1d4b/step-b7c77510.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Add All-American spice blend, beans and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in passata, the stock powder, water (for the stew), brown sugar and remaining butter.\n• Simmer until thickened, 2-3 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6948a1c05c42f1f3135f1d4b/step-6ee82f20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice and stew between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over the chilli flakes (if using). Serve with radish salad and light sour cream to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6948a1c05c42f1f3135f1d4b/step-6b91f930.jpg"
    }
  ]
